  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Maize.Beneficiaries: 324 (15 women).Description: The group seeks to Increase members&apos; yields through improved inputs and techniques and expand the area under production from 389ha to 561ha; increase maize sales through grouped sales and warrantage; and provide plowing and shelling services to members.</narrative>
